# Stable spec ID: punch-mint-julep. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(bourbon) 2-2 1/2 oz
(simple syrup, 1:1 sugar to water) 1/2-3/4 oz
(mint) 1 large sprig

::equipment
(muddler)
(serving vessel) = (julep tin) -OR- (rocks glass)

::instructions
(mint) + (simple syrup) <muddle, gently in (serving vessel)>
<fill, vessel with finely crushed ice>
(bourbon) <pour, over ice>
<add, more crushed ice to mound above the rim>
<garnish, with a lightly slapped bouquet of mint>

